The Chrysalis rewires your learning pathways. Techniques come faster,
but raw physical and mental growth stalls.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
